# B-729 coverage: instance method body is a VarRef (not [fn ...]).
# Triggers lower-warning: "non-fn body cannot carry instance_of stamp".
# The warning is emitted to stderr at lowering time; program evaluates normally.
# The VarRef body is still a valid function, just without dispatch instance_of.
[
  Show: [class [let a]]
  my-show: [fn@String [let x@Integer] [str x]]
  [instance Show [let a@Integer]: [show: my-show]]
  result: [my-show 42]
]
---
%.result
=== out
String("42")
=== warn
never consumed by the next pipeline stage
